        <Ontology1296772722296:Reference>Jankovic, J. J. T. E., &amp; Tolosa. (2007). Parkinson&apos;s disease and movement disorders. E. Tolosa (Ed.). Lippincott Williams &amp; Wilkins.</Ontology1296772722296:Reference>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Occurs as a result of muscle contraction against a rigid stationary object.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
        <rdfs:label>Isometric tremor</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- http://www.semanticweb.org/NDDRFO#Japanese_sake -->

