        <PMID>PMID:28806610</PMID>
        <definition>HR(95% CI): 2.24(1.42-3.53)
Risk factors for transition from MCI to AD were being light-moderate alcohol drinker , cerebrovascular disease , hyperlipidemia and diabetes</definition>
        <rdfs:label>Light-moderate alcohol drinker</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


