        <Ontology1296772722296:synonyms>non-kinesigenic dystonia</Ontology1296772722296:synonyms>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>An autosomal-dominant disorder characterized by paroxysms of hyperkinesias, which can include dystonia, dyskinesia, choreoathetosis, and ballism.</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
