        <Ontology1296772722296:synonyms>obsessive-compulsive stereotyped behavior</Ontology1296772722296:synonyms>
        <Ontology1296772722296:synonyms>obsessive-compulsive symptom</Ontology1296772722296:synonyms>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Obsessive–compulsive disorder (OCD) is characterized by complaints of persistent or repetitive thoughts (obsessions) or behaviors (compulsions).</rdfs:isDefinedBy>
