        <Ontology1296772722296:Reference>Barker, M. R., &amp; Rowe, F. D. (Eds.). (2010). Non-dopamine Lesions in Parkinson&apos;s Disease. Oxford University Press, USA.</Ontology1296772722296:Reference>
        <Ontology1296772722296:synonyms>hyposmia</Ontology1296772722296:synonyms>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy>Measurable smell loss that adversely impacts quality of life, the flavor and platability of foods and beverages, nutrition and safety. </rdfs:isDefinedBy>
        <rdfs:label>Olfactory dysfunction</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


