        <definition>A record of a patient&apos;s background regarding health and disease events of blood relatives. A patient&apos;s family medical history may be important in diagnosing existing conditions.
[url:http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCIT_C17726]</definition>
        <reference>NCIT:C17726</reference>
        <rdfs:label>Family history</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    


